# Auto-return (v0.3, Evan, 2026-11-08): a page left alone goes back to Drones 8 s after it was opened or a knob
# last turned on it; SEL + a page's button keeps it ("kept" in the header) until another page. The other
# scenarios have it off (their pages stay put); "autoreturn" turns it on, as on the FM-1.
notips
autoreturn
tap PLAY
wait 500
tap FX
expect view 13
wait 7000
expect view 13
spin K2 1
wait 7500
expect view 13
wait 1000
expect view 0
tap ENV
expect view 2
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
expect view 2
wait 1000
wait 10000
expect view 2
tap FX
expect view 13
wait 8200
expect view 0
press SEL
tap FX
release SEL
expect view 13
wait 9000
expect view 13
tap HOME
expect view 0
